  "source": "Hand-curated supplement to the ASRS abbreviation list. Entries were chosen from the most frequent uppercase tokens in the 2010-2026 maintenance corpus that the ASRS list omits or decodes with a non-maintenance sense. Entries here override the ASRS list.",
